    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience the World After the Battle of Red Cliffs</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/875f3ff909a471f9d33945bc3d274560.avif?t=1750350230\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by traditional <strong>Chinese Lianhuanhua (comic books)</strong> and <strong>90s Chinese textbooks</strong>, <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> brings hand-drawn characters to life, carefully crafted to capture the essence of Chinese artistry. Step into a <strong>2.5D Metroidvania world</strong> styled like a classic Chinese Lianhuanhua!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Gripping Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a mysterious assassin, you set out to eliminate <strong>Cao Cao</strong> on the battlefield of <strong>Red Cliffs</strong>\u2014but why did you lose your memory? Travel across the land, uncover forgotten truths, and meet legendary heroes as you unveil a catastrophe that threatens the world. Will you and your allies be able to save the people from disaster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Vast and Beautiful World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <strong>over ten unique locations</strong>, from peaceful villages to brutal warzones, from endless deserts to snow-covered forests. <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> showcases breathtaking landscapes inspired by China's diverse scenery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/4bda592f921a6530edab03189e8af347.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/4bda592f921a6530edab03189e8af347.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover Hidden Treasures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through exploration and combat, <strong>collect rare treasures</strong> to grow stronger, unlocking <strong>previously inaccessible areas</strong>. Delve into the unknown, acquire powerful artifacts, and defeat formidable new enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/42dbf1347aef8b8afe71084f2dedc731.avif?t=1750350230\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Diverse Cast of Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter <strong>over 80 meticulously hand-drawn enemies</strong>, including formidable warriors, legendary beasts, and ruthless assassins. Each <strong>boss fight</strong> is uniquely designed, featuring beautifully animated enemy deaths\u2014proving that this world is full of surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle in the Air and on Horseback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey is not limited to walking\u2014<strong>storm enemy camps on horseback</strong> or <strong>take to the skies</strong> for intense aerial combat! These unique gameplay segments are woven into the story, ensuring an ever-fresh experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/0be2f85bf2aa5a5ef0699c44bc0f6950.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/0be2f85bf2aa5a5ef0699c44bc0f6950.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/0be2f85bf2aa5a5ef0699c44bc0f6950.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Information</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Demo</strong> of <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> allows players to experience the <strong>comic book-style</strong> visuals and get a taste of this <strong>side-scrolling ARPG</strong> before its full release.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Save Function</strong> \u2013 This special prologue version does not support saving. However, players can replay the <strong>three available stages</strong> as many times as they like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Language</strong> \u2013 To enhance historical immersion, the test version defaults to <strong>Traditional Clerical Script</strong> commonly used during the Three Kingdoms period.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Content Differences</strong> \u2013 The demo may differ from the final release.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an <strong>independent developer</strong>, I am committed to continuously refining the game. This is just the <strong>beginning, not the end</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy the game, please <strong>add <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> to your wishlist</strong>\u2014your support means the world to me!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Thank You for Your Support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join Our Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">QQ Group: <strong>1016824586</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience the World After the Battle of Red Cliffs</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/875f3ff909a471f9d33945bc3d274560.avif?t=1750350230\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by traditional <strong>Chinese Lianhuanhua (comic books)</strong> and <strong>90s Chinese textbooks</strong>, <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> brings hand-drawn characters to life, carefully crafted to capture the essence of Chinese artistry. Step into a <strong>2.5D Metroidvania world</strong> styled like a classic Chinese Lianhuanhua!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Gripping Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a mysterious assassin, you set out to eliminate <strong>Cao Cao</strong> on the battlefield of <strong>Red Cliffs</strong>\u2014but why did you lose your memory? Travel across the land, uncover forgotten truths, and meet legendary heroes as you unveil a catastrophe that threatens the world. Will you and your allies be able to save the people from disaster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Vast and Beautiful World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <strong>over ten unique locations</strong>, from peaceful villages to brutal warzones, from endless deserts to snow-covered forests. <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> showcases breathtaking landscapes inspired by China's diverse scenery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/4bda592f921a6530edab03189e8af347.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/4bda592f921a6530edab03189e8af347.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover Hidden Treasures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through exploration and combat, <strong>collect rare treasures</strong> to grow stronger, unlocking <strong>previously inaccessible areas</strong>. Delve into the unknown, acquire powerful artifacts, and defeat formidable new enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/42dbf1347aef8b8afe71084f2dedc731.avif?t=1750350230\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Diverse Cast of Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter <strong>over 80 meticulously hand-drawn enemies</strong>, including formidable warriors, legendary beasts, and ruthless assassins. Each <strong>boss fight</strong> is uniquely designed, featuring beautifully animated enemy deaths\u2014proving that this world is full of surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c